---
What to look for in code to write a kind's entities

Usage: specforge infer-guide [OPTIONS] [KIND]

Arguments:
  [KIND]
          Entity kind (omit for every declared kind)

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
